invariant: INV-69
file: src/mlkem_poly.c
catches: test/mlkem-builds.sh
reason: mlkem_poly.c, whose noise sampler reads ML-KEM's secret seed,
  includes keccak_neon.h, the step before a secret stream runs on the
  two-way Keccak, whose lanes a compiler may keep in stack slots no wipe
  clears. The script requires that no source in src/ but the two-way
  Keccak's own files and its two samplers include the header or call
  its entries.

--- old
#include "mlkem_zetas.h"
--- new
#include "mlkem_zetas.h"
#include "keccak_neon.h"
